      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Braintree%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from Braintree in Essex, England, and it was originally called Mount Wollaston when settled in 1625.",
